@* 🟢 "مراجعة إشعارات التسوية بالصنف" - النسخة Blazor الموحَّدة لشاشتَى WinForms المؤكَّد أنهما تُنفِّذان
   **نفس الاستعلام حرفياً** (قارَنّا الكودَين سطراً بسطر): Taswya_Money_ReviewItem و Taswya_Money_Review_Multi_Item
   - الفرق الوحيد بينهما فى الأصل هو أى شاشة تفتحانها عند اختيار صف (صنف واحد/أصناف متعددة على الترتيب)؛ بما أن
   بند 16 وحَّد شاشتَى الإضافة/التعديل أنفسهما فى TaswyaMoneyByItem.razor واحدة، أصبح دمج المراجعة أيضاً بلا أى
   فقدان فى المنطق. البحث/القائمة عبر AccountModelsLib.Money_Financial_Notice_ItemsCLS.Get_Money_Financial_Notice_Items
   (بعد إصلاح خلل بناء SQL فيها بموافقتك الصريحة - راجع تعليق الدالة نفسها فى Money_Financial_Notice_ItemsCLS.cs). *@

@page "/accounts/financial-notice/by-item-review"

@using System.Data
@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("FinancialNoticeByItemReviewTitle")</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4" Elevation="1">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Primary" Class="font-weight-bold mb-4">@Tr("FinancialNoticeByItemReviewTitle")</MudText>

        <MudGrid Spacing="3">
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="4">
                <MudNumericField T="long" @bind-Value="_orderNo" Label="@Tr("NoticeNoLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Min="0" />
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="4">
                <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                    <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_dateFromEnabled" Dense="true" />
                    <MudDatePicker Date="_dateFrom" DateChanged="@(d => _dateFrom = d ?? _dateFrom)" Label="@Tr("DateFromLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_dateFromEnabled)" />
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="4">
                <MudStack Row="true" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Spacing="1">
                    <MudCheckBox T="bool" @bind-Value="_dateToEnabled" Dense="true" />
                    <MudDatePicker Date="_dateTo" DateChanged="@(d => _dateTo = d ?? _dateTo)" Label="@Tr("DateToLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Disabled="@(!_dateToEnabled)" />
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>
        </MudGrid>

        <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2" Class="mt-3">
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search"
                       OnClick="SearchAsync" Disabled="@_isLoading">
                @Tr("SearchButton")
            </MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Secondary" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add"
                       OnClick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("/accounts/financial-notice/by-item/0"))">
                @Tr("NewButton")
            </MudButton>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Default" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Info"
                       OnClick="OpenSelectedAsync" Disabled="@(_selectedRow == null)">
                @Tr("DetailsButton")
            </MudButton>
        </MudStack>
    </MudPaper>

    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_errorMessage))
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mb-4">@_errorMessage</MudAlert>
    }

    <MudTable Items="@_rows" Hover="true" Striped="true" Bordered="true" Loading="@_isLoading" Dense="true" Elevation="1"
              T="NoticeRow"
              OnRowClick="@((TableRowClickEventArgs<NoticeRow> e) => _selectedRow = e.Item)">
        <HeaderContent>
            <MudTh>@Tr("SerialColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("NoticeNoColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("DateColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("NameColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("ValueColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("TypeColumn")</MudTh>
            <MudTh>@Tr("NotesColumn")</MudTh>
        </HeaderContent>
        <RowTemplate>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SerialColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.Serial</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NoticeNoColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.OrderNo</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DateColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.OrderDate?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NameColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.SubAccountName</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("ValueColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.Value.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("TypeColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.TransactionTypeStr</MudTd>
            <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("NotesColumn")" Style="@RowStyle(context)">@context.Notes</MudTd>
        </RowTemplate>
        <NoRecordsContent>
            <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-4 mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NoRecordsFound")</MudText>
        </NoRecordsContent>
    </MudTable>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private record NoticeRow(long Id, int Serial, long OrderNo, DateTime? OrderDate, string SubAccountName, decimal Value, string TransactionTypeStr, string Notes);

    private readonly Money_Financial_Notice_ItemsCLS _cls = new();

    private long _orderNo;
    private bool _dateFromEnabled;
    private bool _dateToEnabled;
    private DateTime? _dateFrom = DateTime.Now.Date.AddDays(-30);
    private DateTime? _dateTo = DateTime.Now.Date;

    private List<NoticeRow> _rows = new();
    private NoticeRow? _selectedRow;
    private bool _isLoading;
    private string? _errorMessage;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);

    public void Dispose()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;
    }

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        await SearchAsync();
    }

    private async Task SearchAsync()
    {
        _errorMessage = null;
        _isLoading = true;
        _selectedRow = null;
        StateHasChanged();

        var orderNo = _orderNo;
        var dtFromEnabled = _dateFromEnabled;
        var dtFromValue = _dateFrom ?? DateTime.Now.Date;
        var dtToEnabled = _dateToEnabled;
        var dtToValue = _dateTo ?? DateTime.Now.Date;

        try
        {
            var dt = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                int excp = 0;
                return _cls.Get_Money_Financial_Notice_Items(ref excp, orderNo, dtFromEnabled, dtFromValue, dtToEnabled, dtToValue);
            });

            var rows = new List<NoticeRow>();
            int serial = 0;
            foreach (DataRow r in dt.Rows)
            {
                serial++;
                var transactionType = r.Table.Columns.Contains("Transaction_Type") ? r["Transaction_Type"]?.ToString() : "";
                rows.Add(new NoticeRow(
                    Convert.ToInt64(r["Id"]),
                    serial,
                    Convert.ToInt64(r["OrderNo"]),
                    r["OrderDate"] != DBNull.Value ? Convert.ToDateTime(r["OrderDate"]) : null,
                    r["SubAccount_Name"]?.ToString() ?? "",
                    Convert.ToDecimal(r["Order_Value"]),
                    transactionType == "2" ? Tr("NatureDebitLabel") : Tr("NatureCreditLabel"),
                    r["Notes"]?.ToString() ?? ""));
            }
            _rows = rows;
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _errorMessage = Tr("SystemError", ex.Message);
        }
        finally
        {
            _isLoading = false;
        }
    }

    private string RowStyle(NoticeRow row) =>
        ReferenceEquals(row, _selectedRow) ? "font-weight:bold;color:var(--mud-palette-primary);" : "";

    private Task OpenSelectedAsync()
    {
        if (_selectedRow == null) return Task.CompletedTask;
        Nav.NavigateTo($"/accounts/financial-notice/by-item/{_selectedRow.Id}");
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
